      "hideComponent": "false",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 15 2026 20:04:05 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p>VB Spine is a strategic partner to Stryker with exclusive access to Spine Guidance 5 Software's Mako Spine and Copilot automatic depth stop features for use with VB Spine’s implants in spine procedures. VB Spine implants are also compatible with select technologies from Stryker’s power tools, including the TPX Universal Driver, the System 8 Dual Triger Rotary Handpiece, and the Electric System 6 Dual Trigger Rotary Handpiece. VB Spine's Everest, Everest MI, Everest MI XT, Everest Fenestrated, Xia 3, Serrato, ES2, Mesa 2, Yukon, Xia 4.5, Tritanium PL, Cascadian AN, Cascadia L are also compatible with Q Interbody Instruments (QII) or Q Pedicle Instruments (QPI) when used with the Q Guidance System and Spine Guidance 5 Software. For a list of which products are available from each company, please reference the electronic IFUs on either <a href=\"https://ifu.stryker.com\" target=\"_blank\">ifu.stryker.com</a> or <a href=\"https://ifu.vbspineco.com\" target=\"_blank\">ifu.vbspineco.com</a>. Always refer to the complete device labeling for updated compatibility, instructions and applicable warnings and cautions.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Apr 27 2026 19:55:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
